  "description": {
   "en": "A collection of short stories by Takeyama Yusuke, including \"Legacy Dog Elsa,\" which depicts an adventure in search of \"legacies\" that bring out special abilities, such as Belmince's gun, Cleopatra's treasure, and Clovis's sword. Contains four stories: \"Ouka Chuushinden,\" featuring a female version of Benkei; \"Trans Girl Trance,\" a hero story that became the basis for \"Dual Justice,\" and \"Ouka no Michi,\" which depicts a battle between a swordsman and his master."
